  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>Miir’Ray Store offers stylish, affordable apparel, accessories, and everyday lifestyle products designed for modern individuals and families. Our collections focus on clean designs, comfort, gifting, and wearable pieces that fit real life while still feeling elevated.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Miir’Ray is creator-first. We believe content creators should be paid for their influence, regardless of follower count. Our brand is built on authenticity, community, and fair compensation.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Miir’Ray Makers earn commission on every confirmed sale made through their unique referral link or discount code. Commissions are competitive, tracked automatically, and paid monthly after the return period.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Affiliates may promote Miir’Ray through TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, blogs, or other social platforms using organic content, trends, reviews, and lifestyle videos.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>No minimum followers are required. We value creativity, consistency, and genuine promotion.</p></div></div>",
